            "text": "WN25-SO-000260 - Windows Server 2025 services using Local System that use Negotiate when reverting to NTLM authentication must use the computer identity instead of authenticating anonymously."
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "family": "windows"
            },
            "children": [
